// A Grand Blade — the mining and smithing quest, read off
// `.planning/planning_quests/A Grand Blade.md`. The bladesmith is dead and his
// son cannot take up the work, because his father hid his notes behind a riddle
// about paving your own way.
//
// A stub: the quest stands in the journal as something known of and never begun,
// and the `@@@` on its one stage is what is still owed. `npm run notes` lists it.

# info a-grand-blade
version: 0.1.0
dependencies:
  core
  tulsa

# quest finding-the-notes
title: A Grand Blade
log: The forge in the market row is cold, and the young smith at it does not look like a man who chose the work.

stage taken-up:
  log: I said I would help him find whatever it was his father left him. @@@ unwritten past this line: nothing begins this quest and nothing carries it. It is what earns the use of tulsa.anvil, and the schematic that comes with it.
  complete
